message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Model Flow: following texts through a language model's layers"
abstract: >-
  Follows thousands of texts through the layers of frozen language models and
  measures where the population keeps its shape, where it reorganizes, and
  which of those readings survive controls (an untrained model, robust scaling,
  a second model). Includes a causally tested account of Gemma 4's layer-14
  turn and a pre-registered prediction on Gemma 4 E4B.
